---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../site';
---
<Base title={`About | ${SITE.name}`} description="Stayfile is a small set of free PDF, image and spreadsheet tools that run in your browser." path="/about/">
  <h1>About {SITE.name}</h1>
  <p class="lede">{SITE.name} is a small set of tools for everyday file jobs, such as putting PDFs together or making a photo small enough to email.</p>
  <p>Most sites that do this ask you to upload your file first. That is an odd thing to ask when the file is a bank statement or a signed contract and your own computer could do the work. {SITE.name} does the work on your computer instead.</p>
  <p>It is built on open-source libraries: <a href="https://github.com/cantoo-scribe/pdf-lib">pdf-lib</a> for making PDFs, <a href="https://github.com/mozilla/pdf.js">pdf.js</a> for reading them, <a href="https://github.com/jamsinclair/jSquash">jSquash</a> for WebP and AVIF images, <a href="https://www.papaparse.com/">Papa Parse</a> for CSV, <a href="https://sheetjs.com/">SheetJS</a> for Excel files and <a href="https://github.com/101arrowz/fflate">fflate</a> for zips. HEIC photos are decoded with libheif.</p>
</Base>
